model leg_on_move_twin
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2 G1 S-6 (#211, plan §4): leg_on_move.tally's stated twin, in the smaller form: the cash that lands two days after the order is a second move keyed by the first, dated from its day (0.00 PLN on the 10th, 100.00 PLN on the 12th)."

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind orders: event certain
kind proceeds: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input d0: date
input lag: int

move order: orders
  on d0

move paid[x in orders over ..]: proceeds
  on add_days(x.day, lag)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d0 = 2026-03-10 "s"
  lag = 2 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-10), bal(konto, 2026-03-12)
